{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍有疑虑，却不肯等到全想明白，先接下自己能做的一份。\",\n      \"key\": \"接下能做的一份\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"结果还没把握，他先不去算尽力值不值，真做起来有了些力气，也有点骄傲，越投入越热切，越觉得痛快。\",\n      \"key\": \"越觉得痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着从前珍惜的东西，可过去回不来，他也不能再像从前那样拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"过去回不来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他一想到那些回不去的东西，就急着把心思拉回眼前，起初还信自己没事，后来越劝越露出在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"越劝越露出在意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样垮下去，可一想到仍放不下的事，刚撑起的劲又泄了，越发焦急，怎么也安不下心。\",\n      \"key\": \"刚撑起的劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把行动原则改成他带着疑虑先接下能做的一份，保留对前段非得想透才肯动的第一次改写。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\", \"R8\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"合并行动带来的力量、骄傲和投入中的痛快，保留没有把握仍愿尽力的变化。痛快是真实的，但不代表牵挂已经消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把一小块心没跟上高昂的抽象说法，改成他仍惦记从前珍惜却不能再像过去那样拥有的东西，解释旧日记忆为何仍在却已遥远。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R7\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不让疑虑做主、不再审视自己的概括，改成他察觉失落后急着把心思拉回眼前，反复劝自己没事。起初尚且相信，后来越劝越露出在意，对应自我控制逐渐勉强的过程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R9\", \"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"重组并补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不甘心垮下去的顽抗，也写出未放下的牵挂怎样使刚撑起的劲再次泄掉。让行动中的痛快与底下的焦急同时成立，解释段内反复起落和始终无法安定的状态。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4a80843d-876b-4242-90e2-b3206faa5c9d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232436507791Z", "elapsed_seconds": 96.672, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:26:13.192399+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e6586b5ee01e9820fd0f8fc07e7f15bcbb0a55440130cd6303c8ded7ddea0f83", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6